Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_SALES_PRICE,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_SAME_DAY_LQ 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_ITEM_SK >= 17575 AND 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOM = 5


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.CS_SALES_PRICE AS "CS_SALES_PRICE",
  Q2.D_SAME_DAY_LQ AS "D_SAME_DAY_LQ" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q2.D_DOM = 5) AND 
  (17575 <= Q1.CS_ITEM_SK)

Explain level:    Explain from section

